    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Clean HTML to Text (Safe Version)\nconst json = $input.item.json;\n\n// Safe extraction: Use snippet if available, OR try body.html safely using ?.\nconst snippet = json.snippet || '';\nconst htmlBody = json.body?.html || ''; \nconst textContent = snippet || htmlBody || '';\n\n// Remove HTML tags and extra spaces\nconst text = textContent\n  .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ')\n  .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')\n  .trim()\n  .slice(0, 2000);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...json,\n    clean_text: text,\n    email_id: json.id || json.threadId // Store unique ID to prevent duplicates\n  }\n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -16,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Clean HTML",
      "id": "9fb871c0-f07b-4639-a61a-e3aca78b3896"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following email data:\n\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nFrom: {{ $json.from }}\nContent: {{ $json.clean_text }}\n\nYour Task:\nExtract structured data into a valid JSON object.\n\nRequired Fields:\n1. \"summary\": A concise summary of the email (max 30 words).\n2. \"intent\": Classify the intent as one of these: [Invoice, Meeting, Inquiry, Spam, Newsletter, Urgent, General].\n3. \"tags\": An array of relevant keywords (e.g. [\"Finance\", \"HR\", \"Marketing\"]).\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n- Return ONLY the raw JSON object.\n- Do NOT use Markdown code blocks (no ```json)."
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        176,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain (Classify)",
